    - target: {fileID: 4131772620381169364, guid: 93d3f4595478e4f729a902a92dadce81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[0]'
      value: Grandma used to bring me here when I was younger. We would fly kites
        together by the beach.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4131772620381169364, guid: 93d3f4595478e4f729a902a92dadce81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[1]'
      value: It seems this memory is still a little blurry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4131772620381169364, guid: 93d3f4595478e4f729a902a92dadce81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[2]'
      value: Maybe flying the kite again will help Grandma remember more.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4131772620381169364, guid: 93d3f4595478e4f729a902a92dadce81, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogueLines.Array.data[3]'
      value: Then let's restore this memory. Keep the kite in the air and avoid the
        birds!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
